      "id": "claim_851e23a08e794421a0ac06c407e8a9d0",
      "statement": "The job queue (openswe/jobs/queue.py, openswe/jobs/worker.py) stores work in the `job` table by UUID with a `kind` and `payload`, running one-shot or cron-repeated jobs through the JobWorker which claims and dispatches each to its registered handler without invoking an LLM.",
